# NOTICE

`AllErrors24-ok.xtf` is copied unmodified from `geopilot`
(https://github.com/GeoWerkstatt/geopilot), path
`TestData/XtfErrorVisualization/AllErrors24-ok.xtf`.

`AllErrors24.ili` is adapted from the same repository, path
`TestData/XtfErrorVisualization/ili-repository/AllErrors24.ili` - one
attribute (`interlisName : INTERLIS.NAME;`, `ValueTypeClass`) is removed:
`INTERLIS.NAME` is not yet accepted by this runtime's grammar (an
unrelated, pre-existing gap - not investigated or fixed as part of this
change). `AllErrors24-ok.xtf` still declares an `interlisName` value for
that class; the validator correctly reports it as an unknown attribute
(see `tests/test_xtf_xtf24_fixtures.py`), which is expected given the trim.

